parts.text:
Create a polished, responsive Hollowtide bestiary showcase for the single sprite described by the provided Creature Brief. Treat the sprite image and brief as source data: do not alter the sprite, invent lore, stats, labels, or evolution facts, or substitute a different creature.

Display the complete generated sprite image prominently at its original square aspect ratio, with image-rendering: pixelated; keep its original flat magenta background visible. Show the creature name, stage, and essence only when the brief explicitly provides them. Include the full brief in a readable details panel.

Use a restrained field-guide aesthetic with deep charcoal, river-ink blue, bone paper, and muted copper. Keep text high-contrast and responsive. Use only self-contained HTML and CSS; add no external images, fonts, scripts, links, or guessed assets. Do not add nonfunctional download or export buttons. The download file should be only the creature generated and not the bestiary as a PNG File
.

